1
00:00:00,576 --> 00:00:07,167
Proof before payment.
Actual running app. Fictional client and evidence. Existing AI review and verified PayPal sandbox draft.

2
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:13,527
A workspace that fits your working hours.
Complete light and dark appearances, remembered on this device. Every state stays readable.

3
00:00:13,527 --> 00:00:18,575
Compare the work, then follow its evidence.
Genuine AG Grid Community supports search, sorting and milestone selection.

4
00:00:18,575 --> 00:00:25,086
Three separate checkpoints.
Saved evidence → a human acceptance decision → a verified, unsent invoice. These are actual record states.

5
00:00:25,086 --> 00:00:32,098
Start with the promised outcome and the source.
This demonstration log is fictional. Supplied claims are not independent proof that work was completed.

6
00:00:32,098 --> 00:00:39,620
Saved results from a real AI review.
Each cited excerpt must exist in the original evidence. The server discards fabricated quotations.

7
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:46,639
The human decision remains explicit.
These previously recorded synthetic acceptance notes include a decision and reason for every criterion.

8
00:00:46,639 --> 00:00:54,481
An existing PayPal sandbox draft.
This draft was created and verified earlier. The recording will retrieve it again, not create a new invoice.

9
00:00:54,481 --> 00:01:02,137
Verified against the actual PayPal sandbox now.
The application checks invoice identity, one recipient, line item, amount, currency and DRAFT state.

10
00:01:02,137 --> 00:01:09,194
A review trail you can explain.
The activity journal records the sequence. Export the packet to retain criteria, excerpts and acceptance decisions.

11
00:01:09,194 --> 00:01:15,857
Unaccepted work stays separate.
Selecting another milestone reveals its own evidence and locked invoice step. Acceptance is never inherited.

12
00:01:15,857 --> 00:01:23,443
A review form with room for judgment.
Manual review is free to explore. These unsaved example decisions request more evidence; no invoice is unlocked.

13
00:01:23,443 --> 00:01:28,973
Milestone Desk
Evidence you can inspect. Acceptance you control. Sandbox drafts that stay unsent.
